layed with other great  players so  i think james harding is searching for  that searching for that closer which is  kd and kyrie  and i think that they're going to  complement each other i think  everybody's debating they're listening  to all of this and they're understanding  that they have a responsibility  to prove everybody prove us wrong  because nobody believes it's going to  work but guess what  i think it's going to work i got them  winning a championship  i have them winning a championship in  brooklyn i did not say this year  i said within three years the brooklyn  nets  will have a championship and that is the  fact beyond reasonable doubt spitty  i know that you've been a part of some  special teams and all-star in 98 with  the atlanta hawks you had mookie  blaylock and you had to kimbe mutumbo  that was your big three in the atl your  thoughts on this current big three  well you know candice said it best i  know just to add to that  it comes down to communication but it  also comes down to transparent  communication  and also you got to understand is when  you win in a championship  things go on a locker room you're going  to have to be able to be  able to definitely have those  conversations that  you don't want to have and that's what i  think me december mookie had i mean  we had times where we would go after  each other  i mean and it was it was all like  candace said because we all was ready to  win  and we were trying to win i think for  this big three right now is  somebody's gonna have to sacrifice  somebody's got to be more of a  facilitator some people's gonna have to  defend more  but i think more importantly you go also  have to understand is you can't  exclude your other teammates they gotta  feel a part of this  when you want to win a championship  because it's more than just that big  three  and if they can get those guys involved  and not stand around  in constant motion i think they'll be  okay  there it is no objection for candice and